  "title": "Aunt Mary&#39;s Cookies",
  "description": "No-bake chocolate cookies made with graham cracker crumbs, cocoa, and marshmallow creme are boiled on the stove top and dropped by spoonfuls onto waxed paper to set up. This is an old recipe handed down in a family for generations.",
  "authors": [
